OL,3,A"Ominous signs" of winter pressures as
OL,4,ANHS waiting list grows
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are "ominous signs" that winter
OL,7,Fpressures are already affecting the NHS
OL,8,Fin England, according to senior health
OL,9,Fleaders.
OL,11,FThe warning comes as new data reveals
OL,12,Fthe waiting list for routine hospital
OL,13,Ftreatment in England rose for the
OL,14,Fsecond month in a row.
OL,16,FAn estimated 7.37 million treatments
OL,17,Fwere waiting to be carried out at the
OL,18,Fend of August, relating to 6.24 million
OL,19,Fpatients.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
