OL,3,A"Ominous signs" of winter pressures as
OL,4,ANHS waiting list grows
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe numbers are the highest since
OL,7,FOctober 2025 and have raised questions
OL,8,Fover whether the NHS will meet a
OL,9,Fgovernment target of treating 92% of
OL,10,Fpatients within 18 weeks by 2029.
